<title>UK: Schleswig-Holstein Hypo adds 100 mln marks to bond.</title>
<headline>Schleswig-Holstein Hypo adds 100 mln marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 200 million marks from 100 million marks, lead manager Commerzbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEINISCHE LANDSCHAFT HYPOBANK</p>
<p> AMT  **200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.50	MATURITY    16.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE REX-LINKED	ISS PRICE  100.30    PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN COUPON LINKED TO REX 10-YEAR</p>
<p>YIELD</p>
<p>		SUBINDEX TIMES 80 PCT. PFANDBRIEF SERIES 642</p>
<p>	    **ORIGINAL 100 MLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED 04.JUL AT 100.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
